<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review/1> a prov:Entity ; rdfs:label "New definition for “Categorization”"@en ; rdfs:comment "“Information and digital assets must be classified according to the organization's information security needs, based on confidentiality, integrity, availability, and relevant interested party requirements.”"@en ; dct:subject <https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/application-business-taxonomy/categorization> ; dct:type "definition" ; prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review> .
<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review/2> a prov:Entity ; rdfs:label "New definition for “Filters”"@en ; rdfs:comment "“Used for evaluating a dataset against predetermined rules, conditions, or business logic to selectively include, exclude, or partition records or attributes for downstream processing, analysis, storage, or access.”"@en ; dct:subject <https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/application-business-taxonomy/filters> ; dct:type "definition" ; prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review> .
<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review/3> a prov:Entity ; rdfs:label "New definition for “Governance”"@en ; rdfs:comment "“The holistic system of decision rights, policies, standards, and accountability frameworks that oversees how raw data is collected and managed, how semantic meaning and relationships are standardized, how analytical insights are derived, and how artificial intelligence models are developed and deployed—ensuring compliance, ethical alignment, operational trustworthiness, and business value across the entire intelligence lifecycle.”"@en ; dct:subject <https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/application-business-taxonomy/governance> ; dct:type "definition" ; prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review> .
<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review/4> a prov:Entity ; rdfs:label "New definition for “Ownership”"@en ; rdfs:comment "“The recognized right and practical capability to exercise exclusive control over a digital asset—including the powers to access, use, derive economic benefit from, restrict others from accessing, and irrevocably transfer or dispose of that asset—either through legal title (contractual and intellectual property rights) or cryptographic control (possession of private keys and ledger state authority)”"@en ; dct:subject <https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/application-business-taxonomy/ownership> ; dct:type "definition" ; prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T163849Z-review> .
}

